    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d628">

                <pb facs="0759" n="685" xml:id="pg685"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/2790</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Moscow</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Poole</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]<anchor n="1" xml:id="d628-f1"
                        /></seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-09-09">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 9, 1918</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received September 26, 5.05 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5. … Massacre of Russian citizens by Bolshevik government continues. Shootings at
                    Moscow number about 150 nightly. More than 1,000 people have been shot in
                    retaliation for attempt on Lenin. I have
                    protested personally to Chicherin
                    pointing out that Bolshevik cause totters on verge of complete moral bankruptcy.
                        Wardwell has written strong protest
                    in the name of American Red Cross. But Commissariat Foreign Affairs has no
                    control and but small influence over extraordinary commission which is carrying
                    on the carnage. The situation is tragic beyond words and it is difficult to see
                    from what quarter relief may come. …</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Poole</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
